{
  "sn1.34:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.34 ",
  "sn1.34:0.2": "4. Satullapakāyikavagga ",
  "sn1.34:0.3": "Nasantisutta ",
  "sn1.34:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "sn1.34:1.2": "Atha kho sambahulā satullapakāyikā devatāyo abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkantavaṇṇā kevalakappaṁ jetavanaṁ obhāsetvā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhaṁsu. ",
  "sn1.34:1.3": "Ekamantaṁ ṭhitā kho ekā devatā bhagavato santike imaṁ gāthaṁ abhāsi: ",
  "sn1.34:2.1": "“Na santi kāmā manujesu niccā, ",
  "sn1.34:2.2": "Santīdha kamanīyāni yesu baddho; ",
  "sn1.34:2.3": "Yesu pamatto apunāgamanaṁ, ",
  "sn1.34:2.4": "Anāgantā puriso maccudheyyā”ti. ",
  "sn1.34:3.1": "“Chandajaṁ aghaṁ chandajaṁ dukkhaṁ, ",
  "sn1.34:3.2": "Chandavinayā aghavinayo; ",
  "sn1.34:3.3": "Aghavinayā dukkhavinayo”ti. ",
  "sn1.34:4.1": "“Na te kāmā yāni citrāni loke, ",
  "sn1.34:4.2": "Saṅkapparāgo purisassa kāmo; ",
  "sn1.34:4.3": "Tiṭṭhanti citrāni tatheva loke, ",
  "sn1.34:4.4": "Athettha dhīrā vinayanti chandaṁ. ",
  "sn1.34:5.1": "Kodhaṁ jahe vippajaheyya mānaṁ, ",
  "sn1.34:5.2": "Saṁyojanaṁ sabbamatikkameyya; ",
  "sn1.34:5.3": "Taṁ nāmarūpasmimasajjamānaṁ, ",
  "sn1.34:5.4": "Akiñcanaṁ nānupatanti dukkhā. ",
  "sn1.34:6.1": "Pahāsi saṅkhaṁ na vimānamajjhagā, ",
  "sn1.34:6.2": "Acchecchi taṇhaṁ idha nāmar�